{
  "provider": {
    "version": 0,
    "block": {
      "attributes": {
        "address": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "Set account 1password domain address (e.g: something.1password.com). Also `OP_ADDRESS` env var can be used.",
          "description_kind": "plain",
          "optional": true
        },
        "email": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "Set account 1password email. Also `OP_EMAIL` env var can be used.",
          "description_kind": "plain",
          "optional": true
        },
        "fake_storage_path": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "File to a path where the provider will store the data as if it is 1password (this is used only on development). Also `OP_FAKE_STORAGE_PATH` env var can be used.",
          "description_kind": "plain",
          "optional": true
        },
        "op_cli_path": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "The path that points to the op cli binary. Also `OP_CLI_PATH` env var can be used. (by default `op` on system path, ignored if run in Terraform cloud).",
          "description_kind": "plain",
          "optional": true
        },
        "password": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "Set account 1password password. Also `OP_PASSWORD` env var can be used.",
          "description_kind": "plain",
          "optional": true,
          "sensitive": true
        },
        "secret_key": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "Set account 1password secret key. Also `OP_SECRET_KEY` env var can be used.",
          "description_kind": "plain",
          "optional": true,
          "sensitive": true
        }
      },
      "description": "\nThe Onepassword organization provider is used to interact with 1password organization resources (users, groups...)\nand not items.\n\nNormally this provider will be used to automate the user and groups management like user onboard/offboards or\ngrouping users into teams (groups in 1password).\n\n## Requirements\n\nThis provider needs [op](https://1password.com/downloads/command-line/) v2.x Cli, thats why it doesn't use 1password connect\nAPI and needs a real 1password account as the authentication.\n\n## Authentication\n\nNeeds a real 1password account so the provider can use the \"password\" and \"secret key\" of that account.\n\nA recommended way would be creating an account in the 1password organization/company only for automation\nlike Terraform (used by this provider).\n\n## Terraform cloud\n\nThe provider will detect that its executing in terraform cloud and will use the embedded op CLI for this purpose\nso it satisfies the op Cli requirement inside Terraform cloud workers.\n",
      "description_kind": "plain"
    }
  },
